44	    /**
45	     Parse a CSS query into an Evaluator. If you are evaluating the same query repeatedly, it may be more efficient to
46	     parse it once and reuse the Evaluator.
47	
48	     @param query CSS query
49	     @return Evaluator
50	     @see Selector selector query syntax
51	     @throws Selector.SelectorParseException if the CSS query is invalid
52	     */
